+# UGV Provider PRD Gap Matrix
+
+This matrix compares PRD requirements `R-P01.*` through `R-P16.*` with the
+execution-time baseline. `PENDING_SIMULATOR_*` is not a local failure and is
+never promoted by mock or deterministic fixtures.
+
+| Requirement                          | Classification              | Current status at baseline                                                                             | Simulator-independent? | Action                                                                                                           | Acceptance test                                                     | External dependency                              | Final status                                                              |
+| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------: | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| R-P01 identity/resource              | HARDEN_NOW                  | Defaults existed but product logic still used `ugv1` literals.                                         |                    yes | Add configured public resource/entity/vehicle identity and reject resource drift.                                | Config, manifest, task, event, and mismatch tests.                  | none                                             | LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_PASS                                                 |
+| R-P02 execution mode/safety          | IMPLEMENT_NOW               | Runtime requests outside simulation failed with `UGV_EXECUTION_MODE_UNSUPPORTED`; fire was exposed.    |                    yes | First-class simulation/live gate, forbid live mock, default-disable fire.                                        | Mode matrix and zero-fire-call tests.                               | Live contract confirmation remains external.     | LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_CONTRACT                    |
+| R-P03 Device MCP compatibility       | IMPLEMENT_NOW               | Tool-name checks existed; operation-specific schema/result qualification was incomplete.               |                    yes | Add compatibility profile and required/optional per-operation qualification.                                     | Deterministic compatible/mismatch/missing fixtures.                 | Real `tools/list` and result semantics.          | MOCK_CONTRACT_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_CONTRACT                           |
+| R-P04 MQTT/freshness                 | HARDEN_NOW                  | Five domains and freshness existed; dispatch correlation lacked explicit per-topic authority/sequence. |                    yes | Persist source/ingest authority and require post-baseline facts.                                                 | Stale, reordered, duplicate, and fresh observation tests.           | Simulator ordering/freshness behavior.           | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_OBSERVATION            |
+| R-P05 state/capability queries       | HARDEN_NOW                  | Stable read operations existed.                                                                        |                    yes | Propagate configured identity and compatibility-derived availability without inventing facts.                    | Contract and unavailable/unknown tests.                             | Live device reports.                             | MOCK_CONTRACT_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_CONTRACT                           |
+| R-P06 navigation                     | IMPLEMENT_NOW               | Mission lifecycle existed; terminal success could rely on mission state alone.                         |                    yes | Freeze baseline; require active mission plus fresh correlated position/speed; emit objective displacement facts. | Point/route/distance/return-home deterministic evidence tests.      | Physical trajectory and tolerance qualification. | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_PHYSICAL_QUALIFICATION |
+| R-P07 pause/resume/cancel            | HARDEN_NOW                  | ACK and task state were partially coupled.                                                             |                    yes | Persist command fence and wait for new physical facts before confirming state.                                   | ACK-only, stale, uncertain, and confirmed control tests.            | Real control timing and stop behavior.           | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_PHYSICAL_QUALIFICATION |
+| R-P08 emergency stop                 | HARDEN_NOW                  | Stop chain existed; missing speed could be interpreted too optimistically.                             |                    yes | Require fresh post-dispatch speed, inactive tracks, and released lock.                                           | Missing/stale/nonzero/fresh-zero deterministic tests.               | Real stop latency and safety-site qualification. | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_PHYSICAL_QUALIFICATION |
+| R-P09 area reconnaissance            | HARDEN_NOW                  | Recon lifecycle existed with limited terminal result facts.                                            |                    yes | Add correlated scan/coverage/target/exception terminal facts.                                                    | Fresh, stale, mismatch, fault, and terminal fixture tests.          | Simulator recon observations.                    | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_OBSERVATION            |
+| R-P10 targets/gimbal/laser           | HARDEN_NOW                  | Stable operations existed.                                                                             |                    yes | Gate availability through tool compatibility and retain local-only target truth.                                 | Operation contract/availability tests.                              | Optional real tool presence.                     | MOCK_CONTRACT_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_CONTRACT                           |
+| R-P11 evidence/terminal confirmation | IMPLEMENT_NOW               | Evidence existed but lacked a shared physical dispatch baseline model.                                 |                    yes | Separate ACK, observations, objective facts, and terminal; reject pre-baseline evidence.                         | Evidence schema, baseline, correlation, and no-synthesis tests.     | External observation authority.                  | DETERMINISTIC_OBSERVATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_OBSERVATION            |
+| R-P12 retry/uncertain/availability   | HARDEN_NOW                  | Read retry and tool circuit existed; operation failure budget/hysteresis was absent.                   |                    yes | Integrate tool health into operation HEALTHY/DEGRADED/OPEN/RECOVERING state; never replay ambiguous mutations.   | Retry, open, recovery, jitter, and no-replay tests.                 | Real failure/recovery behavior.                  | LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_OBSERVATION                 |
+| R-P13 persistence/recovery           | HARDEN_NOW                  | PostgreSQL store and reconcile existed.                                                                |                    yes | Persist physical baseline/control fence and prove restart does not issue duplicate start.                        | Memory and PostgreSQL recovery tests.                               | Long-running simulator disconnect/recovery.      | LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_PASS / PENDING_SIMULATOR_PHYSICAL_QUALIFICATION      |
+| R-P14 configuration/security         | IMPLEMENT_NOW               | Production transport/store gates existed; new product controls were absent.                            |                    yes | Add managed identity/mode/fire/confirmation/failure-budget fields with live fail-closed rules.                   | Schema inventory, production, secret, and config propagation tests. | Deployment-supplied endpoints/secrets.           | LOCAL_IMPLEMENTATION_PASS                                                 |
+| R-P15 subsequent P0 extensions       | OUT_OF_SCOPE                | Roadmap only.                                                                                          |             no blocker | Do not add power/turn/payload-view/media operations in this goal.                                                | Scope-lock audit.                                                   | Product prioritization and contracts.            | ROADMAP_NOT_V1_1_BLOCKER                                                  |
+| R-P16 vehicle facts/events           | PENDING_ENGINEERING_PROFILE | Roadmap stabilization only.                                                                            |             no blocker | Preserve objective facts and document public degraded-enum representation gap.                                   | Scope-lock and event-catalog regression.                            | Product contract freeze.                         | ROADMAP_NOT_V1_1_BLOCKER                                                  |
